// F12: shell of a loft from square to circle fails („SmApiShellBrepFull failed:
// SM_ERR_NULL_POINTER … SmMerge.cpp:672“, the fallback via booleans as well). A loft
// circle → circle can be shelled. Workaround in the plant pot: difference of two lofts.
// Status (report 13): open – SMLib shell and fallback fail.
// SOLL: fehlerfrei
shell(2) {
    loft() {
        square(70, center = true);
        translate([0, 0, 90]) circle(50);
    }
    translate([-60, -60, 89.5]) cube([120, 120, 1]);
}
